#. module: eh_account_dynamic_reports
#: model:eh.account.dynamic.report,description:eh_account_dynamic_reports.report_general_ledger
msgid ""
"Per account ledger with opening balance, every journal item in the period "
"(date, journal, move, partner, label, debit, credit, running balance), and "
"an account total. Drill down: account headers open the journal items list "
"filtered to that account; entry rows open the specific journal entry form."
msgstr ""
"按帳戶列示的分類帳，包含期初餘額、期間內每一筆日記帳明細（日期、日記帳、分錄、業務夥伴、標籤、借方、貸方、累計餘額）以及帳戶合計。深入分析：帳戶標題開啟篩選至該帳戶的日記帳明細清單；分錄列開啟特定的日記帳分錄表單。"

#. module: eh_account_dynamic_reports
#: model:eh.account.dynamic.report,description:eh_account_dynamic_reports.report_bank_reconciliation
msgid ""
"Per bank or cash journal, a reconciliation proof that bridges the last "
"statement balance plus outstanding receipts minus outstanding payments to "
"the book balance per GL, flagging any unexplained difference with a balance "
"check. Outstanding receipts and payments list the individual unreconciled "
"items with drill-down. A journal with no statement shows the book balance "
"with an empty outstanding section rather than an error."
msgstr ""
"針對每個銀行或現金日記帳，提供一份對帳證明，將最後一次對帳單餘額加上未清收款減去未清付款與 GL "
"帳面餘額進行橋接，並透過餘額核對標記任何無法解釋的差異。未清收款和付款列出各筆未對帳項目並支援深入分析。沒有對帳單的日記帳將顯示帳面餘額，未清部分為空，而非報錯。"

#. module: eh_account_dynamic_reports
#: model:eh.account.dynamic.report,description:eh_account_dynamic_reports.report_partner_ledger
msgid ""
"Per partner ledger with opening balance, every journal item in the period "
"attached to that partner, and a partner total. Drill down: partner headers "
"open the journal items list filtered to that partner; entry rows open the "
"specific journal entry form."
msgstr ""
"按業務夥伴列示的分類帳，包含期初餘額、期間內歸屬於該業務夥伴的每一筆日記帳明細以及業務夥伴合計。深入分析：業務夥伴標題開啟篩選至該業務夥伴的日記帳明細清單；分錄列開啟特定的日記帳分錄表單。"

#. module: eh_account_dynamic_reports
#: model:eh.account.dynamic.report,description:eh_account_dynamic_reports.report_customer_statement
msgid ""
"Per-partner statement of open invoices and recent payments on the receivable"
" account, ordered by date with a running balance and a final amount due. "
"Driven by the same partial-reconcile rewind as the aged report so a back-"
"dated statement reflects what was open on that date."
msgstr ""
"按業務夥伴列示的應收帳款上未結發票和近期付款對帳單，按日期排序，含累計餘額和最終應付金額。由與帳齡報告相同的部分對帳回退機制驅動，因此回溯日期的對帳單反映該日期時的未結情況。"

#. module: eh_account_dynamic_reports
#: model:eh.account.dynamic.report,description:eh_account_dynamic_reports.report_profit_and_loss
msgid ""
"Period income statement with Income and Expenses sections plus Net Profit. "
"Two SQL passes (one per section) with the standard filter set; drill down to"
" journal items per account."
msgstr "包含收入和費用部分以及淨利潤的期間損益表。兩次 SQL 查詢（每個部分一次）使用標準篩選集；可按科目下鑽到日記帳項目。"

#. module: eh_account_dynamic_reports
#: model:eh.account.dynamic.report,description:eh_account_dynamic_reports.report_deferred_expense
msgid ""
"Period-by-period deferred expense recognition waterfall, auto-discovered "
"from the asset ledger. Same bucketed layout as the Deferred Revenue schedule"
" but scoped to deferred-expense deferrals. Requires the Asset Management "
"module to populate; renders an empty schedule with a note when it is not "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"按期遞延費用認列瀑布表，自資產分類帳自動發現。與遞延收入明細表採用相同的分桶佈局，但僅限於遞延費用遞延項。需要資產管理模組才能填入；未安裝時呈現帶說明的空明細表。"

#. module: eh_account_dynamic_reports
#: model:eh.account.dynamic.report,description:eh_account_dynamic_reports.report_deferred_revenue
msgid ""
"Period-by-period deferred revenue recognition waterfall, auto-discovered "
"from the asset ledger. One row per deferral with a Before bucket, monthly "
"(or coarser for wide windows) in-window buckets, a Later bucket and a row "
"Total. Honours posted-only and drills to the recognition journal entries. "
"Requires the Asset Management module to populate; renders an empty schedule "
"with a note when it is not installed."
msgstr ""
"按期遞延收入認列瀑布表，自資產分類帳自動發現。每個遞延項一列，包含「之前」桶、視窗內的按月（寬視窗時更粗）桶、「之後」桶和列合計。僅計入已過帳並可下鑽到認列日記帳分錄。需要資產管理模組才能填入；未安裝時呈現帶說明的空明細表。"

